{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-24T17:45:27.046Z","data":{"text":"Task complete.\n\n**Summary**\n\nImplemented the `start-ingress` reconcile behavior and busy-port error explanation for change `013-ingress-resilience`:\n\n- **`src/commands/context.ts`**: Added `explainError` and made `runAction` rethrow a `PortInUseError` as a plain `Error` with that message, so every CLI command prints the busy-port line.\n- **`src/commands/reconcile.ts`**: `readCaddyRoutes` now distinguishes `running`/`stopped`/`missing`; a stopped `paas-caddy` produces one `start-ingress` item (`planned` on dry-run, `started, <n> routes` or `failed: …` otherwise) and skips `push-ingress`.\n- **`tests/ingress-resilience-cli.test.ts`**: New in-process tests covering all six acceptance lines.\n\nBoth the task verify (`node --import tsx --test tests/ingress-resilience-cli.test.ts`) and the proposal verify (`pnpm verify`: typecheck + 409 tests) pass. Result written to `openspec/changes/013-ingress-resilience/.run/results/3.md`."}}
